m. Therefore, I assign **H** (High) as the integrity impact.\n\n**Availability Impact (A):**\nThe vulnerability could potentially lead to a denial-of-service (DoS) or a disruption of service if an attacker exploits it to delete or modify critical files in the vulnerable GitHub repository. Therefore, I assign **H** (High) as the availability impact.\n\n**Vector String:**\nBased on the above assessments, the vector string would be:\n```\nCVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H\n```\n\n**Base Score:**\nUsing the CVSS v3.1 base metric calculator, I calculate the base score to be **8.5**.\n\nHere is the output in JSON format:\n```json\n{\n  \"attack_vector\": \"A\",\n  \"attack_complexity\": \"L\",\n  \"privileges_required\": \"L\",\n  \"user_interaction\": \"N\",\n  \"scope\": \"U\",\n  \"confidentiality_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"integrity_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"availability_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"vector_string\": \"CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H\",\n  \"base_score\": 8.5\n}\n```\nPlease note that this assessment is based solely on the provided vulnerability description and does not take into account any external knowledge or assumptions.",
